# Web build output.
# Cloudflare Workers Builds ignores wrangler.jsonc's build.command and its
# Build command is read-only (=None), so the deploy step (`npx wrangler deploy`)
# has no way to produce dist/. We therefore commit the built dist/ and keep it
# fresh with `npm run build:web` before committing web changes.
# See docs/WEBAPP_DEPLOY.md.
